body_clean:
@iterion suggested in https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/kubernetes/issues/11979#issuecomment-126422608:

> ...considering adding some logging at a higher log level for future debugging.

We've had a few bugs where we were making too many AWS API calls, often in loops. If we logged all our AWS API calls, maybe at V(2) or V(4), then we might have spotted these problems earlier.

